WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:04.974
Oh, hi!

2
00:00:05.523 --> 00:00:07.314
Who are you?

3
00:00:07.868 --> 00:00:10.220
I am a chimpanzee.

4
00:00:10.805 --> 00:00:13.341
Chimpanzees are apes.

5
00:00:14.205 --> 00:00:16.147
Where do you live?

6
00:00:16.529 --> 00:00:19.837
We live in tropical forests in Africa.

7
00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:24.017
We usually stay in trees.

8
00:00:24.603 --> 00:00:26.410
What do you eat?

9
00:00:26.753 --> 00:00:28.929
We eat lots of things.

10
00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:33.465
We like fruit, nuts, leaves, and insects.

11
00:00:34.068 --> 00:00:36.560
Sometimes we eat meat.

12
00:00:37.313 --> 00:00:40.639
Your hands look like human hands.

13
00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:43.556
I can use tools like humans.

14
00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:46.688
We use sticks to find bugs.

15
00:00:48.254 --> 00:00:51.070
We use rocks to crack nuts.

16
00:00:51.626 --> 00:00:53.425
Do you live alone?

17
00:00:54.068 --> 00:00:55.957
No, we live in groups.

18
00:00:56.870 --> 00:01:00.219
Chimpanzees love to be with other chimps.

19
00:01:00.872 --> 00:01:04.438
My group has almost one hundred chimps.

20
00:01:05.162 --> 00:01:08.456
Wow! That must be loud!

21
00:01:08.922 --> 00:01:12.502
Yep! Like humans, we often talk to each other.

22
00:01:12.841 --> 00:01:15.508
We make sounds to communicate.

23
00:01:15.762 --> 00:01:18.858
We also use our faces and hands.

24
00:01:19.724 --> 00:01:21.782
That's cool!

25
00:01:22.501 --> 00:01:24.712
Do you have any enemies?

26
00:01:25.156 --> 00:01:28.210
Sometimes leopards and lions hunt us.

27
00:01:28.543 --> 00:01:32.322
And sometimes we fight other chimpanzee groups.

28
00:01:36.573 --> 00:01:39.469
Oh! Another chimp found a fruit tree.

29
00:01:39.858 --> 00:01:41.996
Time for lunch.

30
00:01:42.866 --> 00:01:45.290
Good-bye, Chimpanzee.

